ster and easier to audit than older protocols like OpenVPN. &quot;],&quot;answerRichText&quot;:[0,null]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;6aa2a702343799e4eede941b&quot;],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;Does Mysterium VPN use WireGuard?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;Yes. Mysterium VPN uses WireGuard as its core protocol, pairing fast, modern encryption with a decentralized network of 7,500+ residential IPs across 100+ countries. &quot;],&quot;answerRichText&quot;:[0,null]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;6aa2a70b343799e4eede941c&quot;],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;Is WireGuard faster than OpenVPN?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;Yes. WireGuard sets up connections faster and carries lower overhead than OpenVPN. Its ~4,000-line codebase is also far easier to audit for security flaws than OpenVPN&#39;s ~400,000 lines.&quot;],&quot;answerRichText&quot;:[0,null]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;6aa2a716343799e4eede941d&quot;],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;What encryption does WireGuard use?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;WireGuard uses ChaCha20 for data encryption, Poly1305 for message authentication, and Curve25519 for key exchange.&quot;],&quot;answerRichText&quot;:[0,null]}],[0,{&quot;id&quot;:[0,&quot;6aa2a723343799e4eede941e&quot;],&quot;question&quot;:[0,&quot;Does WireGuard work on mobile?&quot;],&quot;answer&quot;:[0,&quot;Yes. WireGuard&#39;s stateless design handles roaming between Wi-Fi and mobile data without dropping the tunnel, with less battery impact than older protocols.&quot;],&quot;answerRichText&quot;:[0,null]}]]],&quot;blockType&quot;:[0,&quot;FaqBlock&quot;]}]]],&quot;isForTerms&quot;:[0,false],&quot;termsVersion&quot;:[0,null],&quot;startAt&quot;:[0,null],&quot;endAt&quot;:[0,null],&quot;updatedAt&quot;:[0,&quot;2026-10-19T10:41:58.437Z&quot;],&quot;createdAt&quot;:[0,&quot;2026-09-10T12:37:36.110Z&quot;],&quot;_status&quot;:[0,&quot;published&quot;]}],&quot;relationTo&quot;:[0,&quot;pages&quot;]}],&quot;linkType&quot;:[0,&quot;internal&quot;]}],&q