Last updated: 10 September, 2026 </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="flex gap-2 lg:gap-3 flex-col"> <img src="/api/media/ai-supply-chain.webp" alt="An abstract visualisation of AI" width="2752" height="1536" class="object-cover aspect-auto block box-content max-w-full w-full h-full max-h-54 lg:max-h-100" loading="eager" fetchPriority="high"/>  </div> </div> </div> <div class="flex flex-row gap-20"> <div class="overflow-hidden mt-10"> <div class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.75] text-[color-mix(in_oklab,#F5F4F8_75%,transparent)] [&#38;_p]:mt-4! [&#38;_p]:mb-6! [&#38;_:is(ul,ol)]:my-3! [&#38;_h1]:mt-22.5! [&#38;_h1]:mb-6! [&#38;_:is(h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:mt-10! [&#38;_:is(h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:mb-4! [&#38;_h3+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&#38;_h3+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&#38;_h2+ul]:mt-[1.25em] [&#38;_h2+ol]:mt-[1.25em] [&#38;_h2+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&#38;_h3+p]:mt-[1.25em] [&#38;_p]:m-0 [&#38;_strong]:font-semibold [&#38;_strong]:text-gray-50 [&#38;_em]:italic [&#38;_:is(h2,h3)]:font-semibold [&#38;_:is(h2,h3)]:text-white [&#38;_:is(h2,h3)]:text-xl [&#38;_:is(h2,h3)]:leading-[1.35] [&#38;_:is(h2,h3)]:tracking-[-0.005em] [&#38;_:is(h2,h3)]:mt-[2em] [&#38;_:is(h2,h3)]:mb-[0.75em] [&#38;_a]:text-gray-50 [&#38;_a]:no-underline [&#38;_a]:border-b [&#38;_a]:border-b-[color-mix(in_oklab,#F5F4F8_40%,transparent)] [&#38;_a]:transition-[border-color,color] [&#38;_a]:duration-[160ms] [&#38;_a]:ease-[ease] [&#38;_a:hover]:border-b-gray-50 [&#38;_:is(ul,ol)]:p-0 [&#38;_:is(ul,ol)]:m-0 [&#38;_:is(ul,ol)]:list-none [&#38;_:is(ul,ol)]:flex [&#38;_:is(ul,ol)]:flex-col [&#38;_:is(ul,ol)]:gap-3 [&#38;_li]:relative [&#38;_li]:pl-7 [&#38;_ol]:[counter-reset:prose-counter] [&#38;_ol>li]:[counter-increment:prose-counter] [&#38;_ol>li]:pl-9 [&#38;_ol>li]:before:absolute [&#38;_ol>li]:before:left-0 [&#38;_ol>li]:before:top-0 [&#38;_ol>li]:before:font-roboto [&#38;_ol>li]:before:text-xs [&#38;_ol>li]:before:tracking-[0.12em] [&#38;_ol>li]:before:text-lime [&#38;_ol>li]:before:leading-[1.9] [&#38;_ol>li]:before:content-[counter(prose-counter,decimal-leading-zero)] [&#38;_blockquote]:my-[1.25em] [&#38;_blockquote]:py-[0.25em] [&#38;_blockquote]:pr-0 [&#38;_blockquote]:pl-5 [&#38;_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&#38;_blockquote]:border-l-lime [&#38;_blockquote]:tracking-[-0.01em] [&#38;_blockquote]:text-white [&#38;_blockquote]:text-[clamp(1.75rem,3vw,2.25rem)] [&#38;_blockquote]:uppercase [&#38;_blockquote_p]:m-0 [&#38;_ul>li]:before:absolute [&#38;_ul>li]:before:left-0 [&#38;_ul>li]:before:top-[0.8em] [&#38;_ul>li]:before:size-2 [&#38;_ul>li]:before:-translate-y-1/2 [&#38;_ul>li]:before:bg-lime [&#38;_ul>li]:before:content-[''] [&#38;>*+*]:mt-[1.5em] [&#38;>ul+p]:mt-[3.5em] [&#38;_ul]:gap-5"> <h2 class="" id="key-takeaways"><span>Key Takeaways</span></h2><ul class="list-disc"><li><span>36,769 self-hosted AI endpoints across model servers, agent builders, and vector stores are reachable and identify themselves in a single scanning index.</span></li><li><span>Only 2.02% return an HTTP authentication challenge; for the overwhelming majority, there’s no network-layer gate whatsoever.</span></li><li><span>Open WebUI: 18,529 reachable, 1 behind a gate: The most widely deployed local-LLM front-end has, as a population, no perimeter.</span></li><li><span>6,935 Ollama servers answer their API root to an anonymous request — proven by the response body, not inferred.</span></li><li><span>The agent builders are the dangerous class: 5,223 endpoints across Flowise, n8n, ComfyUI, Dify, RAGFlow, Langflow and Pipelines — tools designed to store credentials. Flowise: 1,341 reachable, zero auth challenges.</span></li><li><span>This is a floor, not a ceiling: Independent scanners have reported Ollama populations near 175,000. Two major vector databases aren’t scanned by this source at all.</span></li></ul><h2 class="" id="the-census"><span>The Census</span></h2><div class="mt-12 sm:mt-14 lg:mt-12 -mx-4 sm:mx-0 px-4 sm:px-0 overflow-x-auto"><div class="min-w-160 rounded-none border-2 border-purple-450 bg-dark-blue-200 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] backdrop-blur-md overflow-hidden"><table class="w-full table-fixed border-collapse"><tbody><tr class="bg-gray-50/2.5"><td class="w-1/5 text-gray-50/90! align-middle wrap-break-word border-r border-purple-450 last:border-r-0 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-7 py-4 sm:py-5 typography-text-inter-sm-medium! sm:typography-text-inter-md-medium-large!"><strong>Class</strong></td><td class="w-1/5 text-gray-50/90! align-middle wrap-break-word border-r border-purple-450 last:border-r-0 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-7 py-4 sm:py-5 typography-text-inter-sm-medium! sm:typography-text-inter-md-medium-large!"><strong>Product</strong></td><td class="w-1/5 text-gray-50/90! align-middle wrap-break-word border-r border-purple-450 last:border-r-0 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-7 py-4 sm:py-5 typography-text-inter-sm-medium! sm:typography-text-inter-md-medium-large!"><strong>Fingerprint</strong></td><td class="w-1/5 text-gray-50/90! align-middle wrap-break-word border-r border-purple-450 last:border-r-0 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-7 py-4 sm:py-5 typography-text-inter-sm-medium! sm:typography-text-inter-md-medium-large!"><strong>Endpoints</strong></td><td class="w-1/5 text-gray-50/90! align-middle wrap-break-word border-r border-purple-450 last:border-r-0 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-7 py-4 sm:py-5 typography-text-inter-sm-medium! sm:typography-text-inter-md-medium-large!"><strong>Auth</strong></td></tr><tr class="bg-transparent"><td class="w-1/5 text-gray-50/90! align-middle wrap-break-word border-r border-purple-450 last:border-r-0 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-7 py-4 sm:py-5 typography-text-inter-sm-medium! sm:typography-text-inter-md-medium-large!"><span>Model servers</span></td><td class="w-1/5 text-gray-50/90! align-middle wrap-break-word border-r border-purple-450 last:border-r-0 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-7 py-4 sm:py-5 typography-text-inter-sm-medium! sm:typography-text-inter-md-medium-large!"><span>Open WebUI</span></td><td class="w-1/5 text-gray-50/90! align-middle wrap-break-word border-r border-purple-45