<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="mt-24 lg:my-22 mb-36 flex flex-col gap-10"> <h2 class="text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] leading-[0.95] text-white uppercase max-sm:typography-heading-5 typography-heading-2 max-sm:typography-heading-8! typography-heading-5!" id="related-articles">Related Articles</h2> <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:px-1"> <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-4 lg:p-6 sm:flex-1 group bg-dark-blue-200 ring-2 ring-purple-450 transition-[box-shadow,background-color] duration-300 ease-out hover:ring-4 hover:ring-lime"> <div> <a href="/blog/news/weekly-recap-november-2-6" class="opacity-90 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200 bg-dark-blue-50 ring-1 ring-purple-450"> <img src="/api/media/Mall Security Camera Monitoring Crowd.webp" alt="mall-security-cameras" height="941" width="1672" class="h-40 w-full lg:h-50 object-cover"> </a> </div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-4"> <a href="/blog/news" class="typography-text-roboto-xxs-semi-bold uppercase w-fit transition duration-300 rounded-full border border-purple-200/20 bg-purple-200/10 text-purple-100 hover:cursor-pointer hover:border-purple-200/40 hover:bg-purple-200/30 px-2 py-1"> News </a> <a href="/blog/news/weekly-recap-november-2-6" class="typography-text-inter-md-medium text-white/80 lg:line-clamp-3 grow hover:cursor-pointer hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300"> Internet Freedom Weekly: News Recap, November 2nd–6th, 2026 </a> <div class="flex flex-row gap-4"> <div class="flex flex-row gap-4 items-center bg-dark-blue-50 ring-1 ring-purple-450"> <img src="/api/media/ina-img.jpeg" alt="ina-img" height="32" width="3